  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n\nAll notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.\n\n## [1.0.0] - 2026-04-21\n\n### 🚀 Features\n\n- *(Controls)* Add VariableContainer control\n- *(Controls)* 神了，jb idea提交的时候默认不带新增文件\n- 为 Tag 提供 Outline classes\n- *(Gallery)* Add switch container showcase\n\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\n\n- *(Controls)* 修复 PlaceholderPresenter 潜在的视觉树更新不正常\n- *(Controls)* 修复 PlaceholderPresenter 潜在的视觉树更新不正常\n\n### 💼 Other\n\n- *(format)* Format\n- *(format)* Format\n\n### 🚜 Refactor\n\n- 修改部分 R# 下的误报写法\n- *(Gallery)* 优化代码页的查看效果\n- *(Controls)* Rename all presenter controls to containers\n\n### 📚 Documentation\n\n- *(config)* Update documentation and project configuration\n- *(ui)* Clarify overlay system architecture and component responsibilities\n\n### ⚙️ Miscellaneous Tasks\n\n- Modify slnx\n- Fix last commit\n\n<!-- generated by git-cliff -->",
